{"verse_key": "14:9", "surah": 14, "verse": 9, "text_uthmani": "أَلَمْ يَأْتِكُمْ نَبَؤُا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِكُمْ قَوْمِ نُوحٍ وَعَادٍ وَثَمُودَ ۛ وَٱلَّذِينَ مِنۢ بَعْدِهِمْ ۛ لَا يَعْلَمُهُمْ إِلَّا ٱللَّهُ ۚ جَآءَتْهُمْ رُسُلُهُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ فَرَدُّوٓا۟ أَيْدِيَهُمْ فِىٓ أَفْوَٰهِهِمْ وَقَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّا كَفَرْنَا بِمَآ أُرْسِلْتُم بِهِۦ وَإِنَّا لَفِى شَكٍّ مِّمَّا تَدْعُونَنَآ إِلَيْهِ مُرِيبٍ", "translation": "Has there not reached you the news of those before you - the people of Noah and ʿAad and Thamūd and those after them? No one knows them [i.e., their number] but Allāh. Their messengers brought them clear proofs, but they returned their hands to their mouths<sup foot_note=196567>1</sup> and said, \"Indeed, we disbelieve in that with which you have been sent, and indeed we are, about that to which you invite us, in disquieting doubt.\"", "verse_from_ms": 216790, "verse_to_ms": 259470, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "أَلَمْ", "start_ms": 216790, "end_ms": 217530}, {"i": 1, "text": "يَأْتِكُمْ", "start_ms": 217530, "end_ms": 218650}, {"i": 2, "text": "نَبَؤُا۟", "start_ms": 218650, "end_ms": 219800}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 219800, "end_ms": 220250}, {"i": 4, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 220250, "end_ms": 221120}, {"i": 5, "text": "قَبْلِكُمْ", "start_ms": 221120, "end_ms": 221840}, {"i": 6, "text": "قَوْمِ", "start_ms": 221840, "end_ms": 224420}, {"i": 7, "text": "نُوحٍ", "start_ms": 224440, "end_ms": 226200}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَعَادٍ", "start_ms": 226200, "end_ms": 226600}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَثَمُودَ", "start_ms": 226600, "end_ms": 227660}, {"i": 10, "text": "ۛ", "start_ms": 227660, "end_ms": 228970}, {"i": 11, "text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 228970, "end_ms": 231780}, {"i": 12, "text": "مِنۢ", "start_ms": 231780, "end_ms": 233820}, {"i": 13, "text": "بَعْدِهِمْ", "start_ms": 233820, "end_ms": 234480}, {"i": 14, "text": "ۛ", "start_ms": 234480, "